alue by working together to streamline the user experience across the entire car buying and selling journey in addition to identifying other digitally focused opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/01/carmax-kmx-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2022 Q4","e":"kmx","d":"2022-04-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rajat Gupta","x":"How confident are you in terms of being able to pass through any benchmark increases or widening in ABS market?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/12/carmax-kmx-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2022 Q4","e":"kmx","d":"2022-04-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rajat Gupta","x":"How confident are you -- in terms of being able to pass through to the consumer in this kind of environment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/12/carmax-kmx-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2022 Q4","e":"kmx","d":"2022-04-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Nash","x":"With used car prices remaining elevated, we chose to pass along some of our self-efficiency acquisition cost savings to consumers via lower prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/12/carmax-kmx-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2023 Q1","e":"kmx","d":"2022-06-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Imbro","x":"I think last quarter, we talked about how some of the other lenders were extending terms to 84 months, that they weren't passing through higher cost of funds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/06/24/carmax-kmx-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2023 Q1","e":"kmx","d":"2022-06-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Imbro","x":"It feels like you mentioned in your prepared remarks that they were starting to pass through some of those higher cost of funds during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/06/24/carmax-kmx-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2023 Q2","e":"kmx","d":"2022-09-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Sharon Zackfia","x":"I guess, historically, you haven't been a company that really has done layoffs materially, if at all.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/09/29/carmax-kmx-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2023 Q3","e":"kmx","d":"2022-12-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Imbro","x":"And then just taking a step back on expenses, I think even last quarter, we talked about one of the reasons that you want to reduce headcount too quickly is the need to hire back and that gets harder next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/22/carmax-kmx-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2024 Q1","e":"kmx","d":"2023-06-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Nash","x":"We'll continue to measure the macro factors, but we do have some nice efficiencies that we've picked up that we've been able to take a little bit to the bottom line, as well as continue to pass through the customer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/06/29/carmax-kmx-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2024 Q1","e":"kmx","d":"2023-06-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Imbro","x":"Other than headcount reduction, can you maybe talk about, Enrique, some of the operational changes you made to drive that improvement in that line item and maybe the sustainability?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/06/29/carmax-kmx-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2024 Q1","e":"kmx","d":"2023-06-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Murphy","x":"But if they don't, is there an opportunity to potentially get more aggressive on SG&A costs through headcount reduction or other areas in case we're in an environment where affordability and supply remain a pretty material issue?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/06/29/carmax-kmx-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2024 Q2","e":"kmx","d":"2023-09-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Imbro","x":"But the weighted average rate here was flat, I think sequentially at 11.1% despite maybe rising benchmark rates and your recent trend of passing-through price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/04/carmax-kmx-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2024 Q2","e":"kmx","d":"2023-09-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Dan Imbro","x":"And are you guys at maybe the end of your ability to pass through more APR at CAF despite the rising kind of rate environment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/04/carmax-kmx-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2024 Q2","e":"kmx","d":"2023-09-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Bottiglieri","x":"So, my question is like, if you look at the full year CAGR that's got in particularly better relative to units, particularly Q2 versus Q1, are you still actively reducing headcount if unit trends maintain normal seasonality from here?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/04/carmax-kmx-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2024 Q4","e":"kmx","d":"2024-04-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Nash","x":"Additionally, we streamline Max offer by rolling out our instant offer experience to all participating dealers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/11/carmax-kmx-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2025 Q2","e":"kmx","d":"2024-09-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William D. Nash","x":"And obviously, as you realize that you then have the luxury of deciding what to do with it, pass it on to customers, or take it to margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/26/carmax-kmx-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2025 Q2","e":"kmx","d":"2024-09-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Pierce","x":"I don't think used car retailers have much pricing power right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/26/carmax-kmx-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2025 Q3","e":"kmx","d":"2024-12-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jon Daniels","x":"We raised prices starting in the fourth quarter of last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/19/carmax-kmx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2025 Q3","e":"kmx","d":"2024-12-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jon Daniels","x":"We fairly price inelastic product that we have and we raised prices last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/19/carmax-kmx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2025 Q3","e":"kmx","d":"2024-12-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Seth Basham","x":"Within retail, can you give us an update on your cost out initiatives?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/19/carmax-kmx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2026 Q3","e":"kmx","d":"2025-12-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Enrique Mayor-Mora","x":"This quarter was impacted by $0.08 of restructuring expenses related primarily to our CEO change and the workforce reductions in our customer experience centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/18/carmax-kmx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2026 Q3","e":"kmx","d":"2025-12-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Enrique Mayor-Mora","x":"Driven by our previously communicated investment in marketing as we supported our new brand positioning launch and the restructuring expenses that I previously noted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/12/18/carmax-kmx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KMX 2026 Q4","e":"kmx","d":"2026-04-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Enrique Mayor-Mora","x":"So we took our prices down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/ea